Ionosphere in myb (ext/ionosphere)

ionosphere.c is written by the authors of myb from:

  - S. Schaer, W. Gurtner, J. Feltens, "IONEX: The IONosphere Map EXchange Format Version 1",
    Proceedings of the IGS AC Workshop, Darmstadt, 1998, and the IONEX 1.1 description (IGS,
    2015): the file format, the interpolation of the maps (bilinear in space, eq. 4; linear in
    time between maps rotated with the Sun, eq. 3);
  - the single-layer model of the ionosphere and its modified form of the Center for Orbit
    Determination in Europe (S. Schaer, "Mapping and predicting the Earth's ionosphere using the
    Global Positioning System", dissertation, University of Bern, 1999).

No code of others is included. The test file tests/data/ionosphere/synthetic.inx is synthetic
(an analytic field written in the format by the authors of myb), not data of any analysis
centre.
